I was able to narrow down a repro:

``` js
// .eslintrc.js
module.exports = {
    "parserOptions": {
        "ecmaFeatures": {
            "globalReturn": true
        }
    },
    "rules": {
        "indent": ["error", 2]
    }
};
```

``` js
// test.js
return (
  42
  );
```

``` sh
$ npm ls --depth 0
~/Desktop/7573
└── eslint@3.10.0

$ node_modules/.bin/eslint test.js
Invalid count value
